00:18:53,453 --> 00:18:56,177
So, that is also another challenge: how to test the usability of

135
00:18:56,545 --> 00:18:57,566
Majuliv VR tour.

136
00:18:59,508 --> 00:19:09,276
Then another challenge is we have to take into account the vast information, both tangible and intangible, as we have seen in the statistics.

137
